Description: MaclinOS Default Settings
 System-wide and per-user default settings for MaclinOS.
 Configures KDE Plasma with macOS-inspired panel layout,
 keyboard shortcuts, window behavior, fonts, and application
 defaults. Settings are applied to new user accounts via
 /etc/skel and system-wide via /etc/xdg.
